<title>USA: Greyhound package service doubles volume.</title>
<headline>Greyhound package service doubles volume.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greyhound Lines Inc said its Greyhound Package Express shipments doubled since the beginning of the United Parcel Service of America Inc on August 1.</p>
<p>Greyhound said it is processing about 22,000 packages a day, with the heaviest volume in Texas, the Southeast and the Northwest.</p>
<p>A Greyhound spokeswoman said the company's package service posted $35 million in revenues last year. She added the company hasn't changed its pricing.</p>
</text>
